{
  "id": "SD-16",
  "group": "数字逻辑基础",
  "title": "集成施密特触发器及其应用",
  "type": "basic",
  "modules": [{ "instanceId": "pls1", "moduleId": "mod-dig-pulse", "slot": "SLOT_BOX_L1" }],
  "allowedInstruments": ["ins-oscilloscope", "ins-func-gen"],
  "reference": {
    "nets": [
      ["ins-dc-power.V5P", "pls1.VCC"],
      ["ins-dc-power.V5N", "pls1.GND", "ins-func-gen.GND"],
      ["ins-func-gen.CH1", "pls1.S14_IN", "pls1.S106_IN"]
    ],
    "measurePoints": [
      { "id": "f_s14", "kind": "waveform", "quantity": "frequency", "minCycles": 2, "between": ["pls1.S14_OUT", "pls1.GND"] },
      { "id": "v_s106_vpp", "kind": "waveform", "quantity": "vpp", "between": ["pls1.S106_OUT", "pls1.GND"] },
      { "id": "f_osc", "kind": "waveform", "quantity": "frequency", "minCycles": 2, "between": ["pls1.S106_OUT", "pls1.GND"] }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "prepare",
      "text": "保持断电，对比 TTL 施密特反相器 74LS14（VT+≈1.7 V、VT-≈0.9 V、ΔVT≈0.8 V）与 CMOS 施密特反相器 CD40106（VT+≈3.0 V、VT-≈2.0 V、ΔVT≈1.0 V）的回差特性及 RC 多谐振荡接法。",
      "measurePoints": [],
      "dataTable": "sch_test"
    },
    {
      "id": "shape_sine",
      "text": "阶段 1（正弦波整形与 X-Y 滞回特性）：断电接 +5V→VCC、公共地，信号源 CH1 接 S14_IN 与 S106_IN，点击“检查接线”；设信号源 CH1 为 1 kHz、4.6 Vpp、+2.5 V 偏置正弦波，示波器 CH1 测 S14_OUT、CH2 测 S106_OUT，上电验证两者均输出 1 kHz 陡峭方波（CD40106 满轨 5 Vpp），可切 X-Y 模式观测矩形滞回环，记录第 1 行。",
      "measurePoints": ["f_s14", "v_s106_vpp"],
      "checkWiring": true,
      "expect": { "measurePoint": "f_s14", "min": 960, "max": 1040 },
      "dataTable": "sch_test"
    },
    {
      "id": "rc_osc",
      "text": "阶段 2（施密特 RC 多谐振荡器）：断电拆去信号源连线，将 CD40106 接成自激振荡器（S106_OUT→OSC_R、OSC_C→S106_IN，Rf=4.7 kΩ、Cf=100 nF），示波器 CH1 测 S106_OUT、CH2 测 S106_IN（时基 200 µs/div）；上电测得稳定方波振荡频率 f_OSC ≈ 2.37 kHz 及电容端 2.0~3.0 V 三角波，记录第 2 行。",
      "measurePoints": ["f_osc", "v_s106_vpp"],
      "referenceNets": [
        ["ins-dc-power.V5P", "pls1.VCC"],
        ["ins-dc-power.V5N", "pls1.GND"],
        ["pls1.S106_OUT", "pls1.OSC_R"],
        ["pls1.OSC_C", "pls1.S106_IN"]
      ],
      "expect": { "measurePoint": "f_osc", "min": 2150, "max": 2600 },
      "dataTable": "sch_test"
    },
    {
      "id": "rc_tune",
      "text": "在线切换振荡电阻 R_OSC=10 kΩ，验证振荡频率减半至约 1.15 kHz（f 与 Rf 成反比），记录第 3 行并断电完成思考题。",
      "measurePoints": ["f_osc"],
      "expect": { "measurePoint": "f_osc", "min": 1000, "max": 1300 },
      "recordTable": "sch_test",
      "dataTable": "sch_test"
    }
  ],
  "dataTables": [
    {
      "id": "sch_test",
      "title": "74LS14 / CD40106 施密特整形与 RC 振荡测试记录",
      "rows": 3,
      "columns": [
        { "id": "f_s14", "title": "74LS14 整形频率", "unit": "Hz", "measurePoint": "f_s14", "captureSteps": ["shape_sine"] },
        { "id": "v_s106_vpp", "title": "CD40106 幅值 Vpp", "unit": "V", "measurePoint": "v_s106_vpp", "captureSteps": ["shape_sine", "rc_osc"] },
        { "id": "f_osc", "title": "RC 振荡频率 f_OSC", "unit": "Hz", "measurePoint": "f_osc", "captureSteps": ["rc_osc", "rc_tune"] }
      ],
      "sanity": [
        { "column": "f_osc", "min": 500, "max": 6000, "message": "100 nF 电容配 2.2~10 kΩ 电阻的 CD40106 振荡频率应在 1.1~5 kHz 范围。" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "charts": [],
  "questions": [
    "施密特触发器的回差电压 ΔVT = VT+ − VT- 如何提高电路的抗干扰能力？",
    "对比 74LS14（TTL）与 CD40106（CMOS）在 5 V 供电下的高低输出摆幅与回差对称性，为什么 CMOS 施密特更适合构成对称 RC 多谐振荡器？",
    "在 CD40106 施密特多谐振荡器中，如何计算振荡周期与 Rf、Cf、VT+、VT- 的关系？"
  ]
}
